      "html" : "<\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-163693\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-163693\"><\/AnnotationDrawer><div><span style=\"color: #000000;font-weight: normal;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,serif;font-size:10pt;\">The holding capacity of the storage tank shall be sized in accordance with the anticipated demand.<\/span><\/div><\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-163694\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-163694\"><\/AnnotationDrawer><div><span style=\"color: #000000;font-weight: normal;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,serif;font-size:10pt;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;<\/span><span style=\"color: #000000;font-weight: bold;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;\">Exception:<\/span><span style=\"color: #000000;font-weight: normal;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,serif;font-size:10pt;\"> Storage tanks also used for rainwater detention may be sized for the combined volume of detained water and the anticipated demand.<\/span><\/div><\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><\/div>",
